      "id": "c1aw389",
      "headline": "the color, font-weight and padding properties of 3 `<div>` elements, buttons and links changed, on 3 of 5 changed screenshots, 60% of changed pixels",
      "text": "## the color, font-weight and padding properties of 3 `<div>` elements, buttons and links changed, on 3 of 5 changed screenshots, 60% of changed pixels (`*`, c1aw389)\n- for example, the \"Save\" button's inner spacing shrank by 8 px, at `getByText('Save')` in \"s1 >> renders\" (s4udgzc)\n- `*` from `reset.css` (unlayered) now sets color (was #0000ff, now #000000), font-weight (was 700, now 400), padding-left (was 8px, now 0px)\n- to restore it: change the rule in `reset.css`, or set the old values in your own stylesheet if `reset.css` comes from a dependency\n- all occurrences: `npx whydiff explain c1aw389`",
      "key": "k2|rule|reset.css|*|",
      "kind": "rule",
      "level": 0,
      "summary": {
        "kind": "rule",
        "selector": "*",
        "sheet": "reset.css",
        "sets": [
